            "title": "شرط التماس",
            "explanation": "\\[f'(x_0)=1\\iff \\frac{g(x_0)}{(x_0+1)^2}=1.\\]"
          },
          {
            "step_number": 2,
            "title": "التبسيط",
            "explanation": "\\[g(x_0)=(x_0+1)^2\\]\n\\[x_0^2+2x_0+4-2\\ln(x_0+1)=x_0^2+2x_0+1.\\]\nإذن:\n\\[3-2\\ln(x_0+1)=0.\\]"
